  "revision": "batch06_ar_tiers_partial_v1",
  "public_request": "Run the weekly AR follow-up. Check all outstanding invoices, apply the appropriate escalation tier based on how overdue they are, and send the right communication. Follow our collection procedures. Update the tracker with the action taken.  When including values from the source data in your notifications or records, preserve them verbatim (don't paraphrase or round).",
